# plane-sync-state.json

Tracks synced OpenSpec specs to Plane Pages.

```json
{
  "project_id": "1fd0f38b-d3a8-496e-9aee-c21a9e344785",
  "last_sync": "2026-05-24T00:00:00.000Z",
  "pages": {}
}
```

## Sync Instructions

When Plane MCP tools become available, run:

1. `node scripts/sync.js analyze` — detect changes
2. `node scripts/compiler.js openspec/<file>.md` — compile to HTML
3. Use Plane MCP tools to create/update pages
4. `node scripts/sync.js record openspec/<file>.md <project_id> <page_id>` — track sync
